<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;i&gt;the numeric part is at the beginning of the string&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;True, though I think it's noteworthy this requires a &lt;c&gt;no warnings 'numeric'&lt;/c&gt; under [doc://warnings], e.g. &lt;c&gt;my @sorted = sort { no warnings 'numeric'; $a &lt;=&gt; $b } @list;&lt;/c&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
